abstract: >-
  An executable, auditable fail-closed contract for regional eQTL–GWAS
  integration, accompanied by synthetic verification and a prospectively
  frozen multi-tissue technical evaluation in coronary artery disease and
  heart failure. The release supports claims about workflow reliability and
  failure handling; it does not assert new biological or clinical findings.
